meta {
  name: Upload file
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/files
  body: multipartForm
  auth: inherit
}

body:multipart-form {
  file: @file()
  folder: resume
}

docs {
  folder: resume (pdf, doc, docx, odt, rtf, jpg, jpeg, png, webp) | company (jpg/jpeg/png/webp) | avatar (jpg/jpeg/png/webp only). The first bytes of the file are checked against its extension. Max 5 MB (413 above). Returns the stored fileName. Logos and avatars are public at /storage/company/<file> and /storage/avatar/<file>; CVs are never public, open them through "Resumes / Open resume document (CV)". Needs hoidanit.upload-file.base-uri (env UPLOAD_BASE_URI) pointing at a local folder.
}
